                                "sense_id": "2c930a43-a18b-38b2-bbdc-bcb356a2bd20",
                                "text": "The positioning of the wrist is related to the upper three joints of the robot arm with three degrees of freedom, for the two motions of the shoulder and the one motion of the elbow, all rotationals."
